      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Urbana%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city’s name origin is unclear, but scholars think Ward and Vance drew from the Latin word “urbs,” meaning city.",
